## 7. Skill Routing

Operations:

| Skill | When to use | Output |
|---|---|---|
| `ingest` | 转换 `_inbox/` / `_raw/` 文件为 markdown cache | source-tracked `_cache/` markdown |
| `new-session` | 新建 / 定位 topic session；解析 artifact 保存路径；轻量更新 `index.md` | topic session scaffold + canonical save paths |

Research:

| Skill | When to use | Output |
|---|---|---|
| `information-impact` | 这个消息靠谱吗 / claim check / 影响什么 | Claim Check + Research Relevance |
| `candidate-screener` | 找 candidates / 找受益股 / 主题筛选 | sourced candidate funnel |
| `stock-quickread` | 快速看一家公司 / 30 分钟过一下 | quickread + data tables + opponent assumptions |
| `next-step` | 下一步怎么研究 / 最高杠杆问题是什么 | one highest-value question + prompts |
| `company-primer` | 公司业务基础、历史演变、segment / KPI 变化 | company foundation + disclosure evolution |
| `mechanism-map` | 行业机制、工程原理、设备链、工艺、know-how gap | mechanism map + value capture |
| `driver-map` | revenue / margin / backlog / price-volume-mix / model-driver gap | reported bucket -> business reality -> model driver |
| `cross-market-compare` | A/H、ADR、跨市场估值差 | normalized valuation + access adjustment |
| `peer-deep-dive` | 横向研究几家公司 / peer comparison | industry lens + peer map + research ranking |
| `pair-trade` | Long X / Short Y / hedge candidate | pair verdict + spread logic |
| `alpha-thesis` | 搭 long / short thesis | variant view + catalyst + kill criteria |
| `bear-pre-mortem` | 找漏洞 / 反向压测 thesis | steelman bear case |
| `earnings-setup` | 财报前 setup / 财报后 quick read | pre-print setup / post-print read |
| `financial-model` | 搭 model / 更新模型 / 拆收入 | model update map / workbook |
| `research-journal` | 沉淀已研究清楚的认知 / Boss Brief | research-journal / boss-brief / topic index update |

如果不确定用哪个 skill，先说明候选和差异，再让用户选；不要猜。

